{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00307","headline":"虚池驿题屏风 · 宜芬公主","name":"虚池驿题屏风","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出嫁辞乡国，由来此别难。\n圣恩愁远道，行路泣相看。\n沙塞容颜尽，边隅粉黛残。\n妾心何所断，他日望长安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宜芬公主","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00307.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00307","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}